            "review_title": "Review at Miyama - Modern Tokyo Restaurant Cafe",
            "review_text": "Hiro\n136 contributions\n1\nFluffy Japanese Strawberry Shortcake To Try\nOct 2019 • Friends\nIt's a stylish Japanese restaurant cafe. I had a latte and strawberry shortcake. The cake was so fluffy and exactly like the one I used to like in Japan. The latte was mild and came with a small green tea biscuit which was also comforting.\nThe place is not that big but the ceiling is quite high and we can see outside through a big glass door in front, so it's relaxing to be there.\nStaff there were very attentive and offered me a glass of water once I finished my latte.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 9, 2019",
